ch has your player  take ammo from a strange tissue on the  wall this could be an opening and  closing Gates which seems to be vital in  keeping enemies away and not wasting  ammo or this could be odd transports  that progress you further into the maze  while the game is a first person shooter  the guns in the game are more about  survival than a fast-paced shooter  experience ammo seems to be incredibly  limited and the player character  definitely doesn't seem to be in a hurry  when it comes to reloading there are  multiple guns we've seen which are all  organic tissue attachments that are  taken off and then applied to the base  gun we've seen a rifle a shotgun a  rocket or grenade launcher type of gun  and his strange piston style gun that  more so punches and impales enemies and  speaking of enemies we've seen slug-like  enemies that spew some sort of acid at  the player a more animal-like  quadrupedal enemy that Rams into the  player and then creatures that look like  they're probably enemies like ambling  humanoids and gigantic heads there's  also whatever this art is which could be  part of an environment or another enemy  something else I want to point out is  that this pod from an older 2020  gameplay clip reminds me of the godhead  member void from berserk and it just  terrifies me when you walk into it  though scorn has elements of shooting  and stealth the primary gameplay Loop is  composed of solving puzzle elements to  the environment is unclear how extensive  these puzzles can get but at the very  least in an 8 minute prologue video app  software released we saw one that  involved putting a misfigured creature  in an egg pod onto a similarly shaped  seat similarly many of the puzzles will  be in figuring out how to utilize the  strange biotechnology of the world from  our previewer Jordan ramay it seems like  the game will be mostly focused on  exploration figuring out these puzzles  and trying to figure out your way around  in obtuse world as far as music goes so  far it has been extremely limited with  environmental sound effects driving the  experience some trailers featured music  and there was some sort of musical  sounds near the void-like Pod but it  seems like the intent of the game is to  throw you into its World however that  world may be  after several Kickstarter delays scorm  was finally set to release October 21  2022 however just recently it was  announced that scorn is actually being  pushed up in release dates and will be  coming out this Friday October 14 2022.  scoring releases for PC on platforms  like steam epic and good old games and  will also be available for Xbox series X  slash X and Game Pass so if you have  game pass this might be the perfect way  to spend Halloween and there you have  everything you need to know about scorn  personally I'm excited to see this  unique Vision come to life especially as  a fan of this lab dexinski it looks  disgusting it looks horrifying and I  cannot wait make sure to stay tuned for  Gamespot For an upcoming review and I'll  see you next time  thank you
 

